<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <%- include('partials/head', { title: 'Sell on Amazon' }) %>
</head>
<body>

    <%- include('partials/sidebar') %>
    <%- include('partials/navbar') %>

    <main class="page-main">
        <div class="feature-hero">
            <h1>Sell on Amazon — Grow Your Business</h1>
            <p>Reach over 10 crore customers across India and globally. Start selling in minutes with easy onboarding and dedicated support.</p>
            <button class="btn-primary" onclick="alert('Seller Registration portal opened! Have your GSTIN and bank details ready.')"
                    style="font-size:1.05rem; padding:12px 28px; background:linear-gradient(to bottom, #f0c14b, #e47911); color:white;">
                Start Selling Today
            </button>
        </div>

        <section class="feature-section">
            <h2>How Selling on Amazon Works</h2>
            <div class="step-grid">
                <div class="step-item">
                    <div class="step-num">1</div>
                    <h4>Register &amp; List</h4>
                    <p>Create your seller account with GST/PAN and list your catalog using easy bulk upload tools.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="step-item">
                    <div class="step-num">2</div>
                    <h4>Orders Arrive</h4>
                    <p>Customers find and purchase your products on Amazon across India and worldwide.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="step-item">
                    <div class="step-num">3</div>
                    <h4>Fulfillment &amp; Delivery</h4>
                    <p>Store in Amazon warehouses with FBA (Fulfillment by Amazon) or ship directly to buyers.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="step-item">
                    <div class="step-num">4</div>
                    <h4>Receive Fast Payments</h4>
                    <p>Funds are deposited directly into your bank account every 7 days, including for cash-on-delivery.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <div class="feature-grid">
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-card-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-users"></i></div>
                <h3>10+ Crore Shoppers</h3>
                <p>Access the largest customer base across India with instant product visibility.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-card-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-truck-fast"></i></div>
                <h3>Fulfillment by Amazon (FBA)</h3>
                <p>Amazon stores, picks, packs, and delivers your products with Prime 1-day delivery.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-card-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-earth-americas"></i></div>
                <h3>Export to Global Markets</h3>
                <p>Sell to over 200 countries through Amazon Global Selling from your home city.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-card-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-headset"></i></div>
                <h3>24/7 Seller Support</h3>
                <p>Dedicated merchant support in Hindi, English, Tamil, Telugu, and other regional languages.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <section class="feature-section">
            <h2>What You Need to Get Started</h2>
            <ul style="line-height:2; color:#333; margin-left:20px; font-size:0.95rem;">
                <li><strong>Bank Account Details:</strong> For timely 7-day payouts</li>
                <li><strong>Tax Information:</strong> GSTIN and PAN details</li>
                <li><strong>Active Mobile Number &amp; Email:</strong> For account verification and order notifications</li>
                <li><strong>At least 1 product to sell:</strong> In any supported retail or handmade category</li>
            </ul>
        </section>
    </main>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>

    <div class="toast" id="toast"></div>

    <script src="/js/common.js"></script>
</body>
</html>

